Features</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"passives\" data-item-name=\"passives\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/38px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/50px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><b>Darkvision</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Can see in the dark up to a certain distance.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_LOW_Prison_Rat01</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_Prison_Rat01+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_Prison_Rat01+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>7ec18c86-b069-4e60-82dd-61a0263d46f0</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7ec18c86-b069-4e60-82dd-61a0263d46f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7ec18c86-b069-4e60-82dd-61a0263d46f0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>LOW_Prison_TraderRat</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_Prison_TraderRat+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_Prison_TraderRat+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Skittle</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Rat\" title=\"Rat\">rat</a> merchant found inside a cell in <a href=\"/wiki/Heapside_Prison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heapside Prison\">Heapside Prison</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>. \n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/70px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/105px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/140px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/70px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">A new client? What a thrill - for you, rat-urally!</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Skittle</a> the rat</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Skittle's cell can be unlocked with the generic key found on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corlos\" title=\"Corlos\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Portrait_Corlos.png/25px-Portrait_Corlos.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Portrait_Corlos.png/38px-Portrait_Corlos.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Portrait_Corlos.png/50px-Portrait_Corlos.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fist Corlos\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Portrait_Corlos.png/25px-Portrait_Corlos.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Portrait_Corlos.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Corlos\" title=\"Corlos\">Fist Corlos</a>, or it can be accessed via a destructible adjacent wall. Skittle can also be spoken to from outside the cell. \n</p><p>In order to trade with Skittle, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\">Speak with Animals</a> must be used.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rat_puns\">Rat puns</span></h2>\n<p>Befitting of a character with <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> 4, they speak almost exclusively in puns. The player can respond in kind.\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Skittle:</b> \"Step up and marvel at the spec-rat-ular wonders on offer!\"</li>\n<li><b>Party member:</b> A mercantile rodent? How rat-ical!</li>\n<li><b>Skittle:</b> Indeed, my mirthful mate. Care to take a squeak at my fan-rats-tical wares?</li>\n<li><b>Party member:</b> Is this business rat-ified by the local merchant's league?</li>\n<li><b>Skittle:</b> My enterprise is a more... covert sort. I do my dealings in squeak-ret.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Store\">Store</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance\" title=\"Elixir of Universal Resistance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/ELX_Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Universal_Resistance\" title=\"Elixir of Universal Resistance\">Elixir of Universal Resistance</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Counting_House_Safe_n%C2%BA2_Key\" title=\"Counting House Safe nº2 Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Gold_A_Ico